1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,608
Your team keeps solving the same problem, but the method never sticks.

2
00:00:04,608 --> 00:00:06,528
Every new chat starts over.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,816
Repeated context, repeated corrections, wasted tokens.

4
00:00:11,816 --> 00:00:15,632
Expertise stays buried in old chats.

5
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:19,779
SkillDNA is a VS Code extension.

6
00:00:19,779 --> 00:00:26,264
It analyzes your approved sessions and turns repeated steps into a reusable Copilot skill.

7
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:29,047
You choose what it sees.

8
00:00:29,047 --> 00:00:31,095
Sessions and files stay local.

9
00:00:31,095 --> 00:00:33,552
Nothing leaves your machine without approval.

10
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:39,988
In Privacy, choose imported sessions or VS Code activity.

11
00:00:39,988 --> 00:00:41,096
First, import.

12
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:46,181
Give permission, choose a workspace and sample.

13
00:00:46,181 --> 00:00:47,999
Here are the sessions.

14
00:00:47,999 --> 00:00:50,272
Review and approve before discovery.

15
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:54,829
Choose VS Code activity in Privacy.

16
00:00:54,829 --> 00:00:58,600
Enable observation, then open and save a file.

17
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:03,536
Pause and check Sessions.

18
00:01:03,536 --> 00:01:07,376
Inspect and edit match the file we opened and saved.

19
00:01:07,376 --> 00:01:09,680
That's how we check the capture.

20
00:01:09,680 --> 00:01:12,368
Approve the evidence, then review a workflow.

21
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:16,894
Generate a skill draft.

22
00:01:16,894 --> 00:01:19,736
Review the instructions and result template.

23
00:01:19,736 --> 00:01:22,104
Edit anything that needs improving.

24
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:27,930
Validate the files, then approve the draft.

25
00:01:27,930 --> 00:01:30,441
It's ready for export and reuse.

26
00:01:30,441 --> 00:01:31,696
You're in control.

27
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:38,104
Ship the method, not just the answer.

28
00:01:38,104 --> 00:01:39,878
Reuse instructions across chats.

29
00:01:39,878 --> 00:01:45,200
Copilot can review each workflow, so only the strongest reach your team.

30
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:47,929
Skill DNA.

31
00:01:47,929 --> 00:01:49,324
Capture the method.

32
00:01:49,324 --> 00:01:50,718
Share the skill.

33
00:01:50,718 --> 00:01:52,112
Move forward together.
